THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL IN examples/

    examples/frcp/corpus/frcp_demo.json
        Abridged from the Federal Rules of Civil Procedure, a work of the
        United States government and not subject to copyright. The text is
        abridged and normalised for demonstration and is NOT authoritative.

    examples/go/corpus/go_demo.json
        A prose rendering of is_a and part_of edges from a small fragment of
        the Gene Ontology, with paraphrased definitions. Gene Ontology content
        is released by the Gene Ontology Consortium under CC BY 4.0. See
        geneontology.org.

    examples/icd11/
        NO ICD-11 TEXT IS REPRODUCED. ICD-11 is copyright the World Health
        Organization. The chain file records structural facts about the
        classification's published architecture, with locators, and nothing
        more. Obtain ICD-11 from WHO under WHO's terms.

    examples/cfr205/
        No corpus ships. 7 CFR Part 205 is a work of the United States
        government and not subject to copyright.

BFO IRIs referenced in spec/owl/ belong to the Basic Formal Ontology, released
under CC BY 4.0 by the BFO development team.
